message: "If you use this software or dataset, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "PublicProcurement-IA: Brazilian public AI procurement corpus from PNCP"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Lopes
    given-names: Marcel
    email: marcel.felipe@gmail.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/machadolopes/PublicProcurement-IA"
url: "https://github.com/machadolopes/PublicProcurement-IA"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible pipeline and analysis corpus for mapping Brazilian public
  contracts related to artificial intelligence in the Portal Nacional de
  Contratações Públicas (PNCP). Includes lexical search queries, contract-only
  destination classification, association tables (class × procurement modality),
  and article figures. Raw search hits and derived outputs are deposited with
  the release assets / Zenodo package.
keywords:
  - public procurement
  - artificial intelligence
  - PNCP
  - Brazil
  - open government data
